# Two paths, one file: e2-proxy-trace/probe.wasm is a HARDLINK of the pre-guard
# artifact, so "same bytes" is not a comparison that could drift -- it is the
# same inode. Only probe.js and sdk-worker.js are patched, and the patch is
# JS-only instrumentation. No relink of anything.
